            "text": "<p>Driven by our founder Georgiana Grudinschi’s mission to simplify beauty and make high-end salon treatments accessible to everyone, we are dedicated to empowering you to take charge of your beauty routines. Through innovative, convenient, and affordable home salon products, we challenge the “experts only” mindset, proving that you can become your own beauty expert.</p>",
